{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7c1e9d2-4a55-4f10-9c3e-communityg01",
    "name": "社区团购系统 · 接口测试（v1.0 冻结版）",
    "description": "案例三 社区团购（生鲜自提）拼团系统 —— 接口契约 v1.0 的可执行测试集合。\n\n## 用法\n1. 导入本文件 + 同目录的「社区团购-本地.postman_environment.json」\n2. 右上角选环境「社区团购-本地」\n3. 先跑 00 连通性，再按 01→05 顺序跑（登录会自动把 token 存进环境变量，后续请求自动带上）\n\n## 重要约定（不是 bug）\n- **业务错误也返回 HTTP 200**，真实结果看响应体里的 `code`。只有 401/403/404/429 这类语义错误才用 HTTP 状态码。\n- 所有成功响应：`{ \"code\": 0, \"msg\": \"ok\", \"data\": ... }`\n- 时间格式统一 `yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss`\n- 需要登录的接口：请求头 `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`（登录请求的脚本会自动写入）\n\n## 覆盖范围\nA 活动域（已实现，全部可跑通）：认证、活动 CRUD、状态机、自提点、团长绑定\nB/C（未实现，接口留占位，返回 404 属正常）",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 连通性",
      "description": "确认后端活着、数据库和 Redis 都连上了",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "健康检查",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('code = 0', () => pm.expect(res.code).to.eql(0));",
                  "pm.test('状态 UP', () => pm.expect(JSON.stringify(res.data)).to.include('UP'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            },
            "description": "免登录。返回 status=UP 说明 Spring Boot 起来了；若 code=500 多半是 MySQL 3308 或 Redis 6380 没起。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 认证（D #10）",
      "description": "登录 → 拿 token 存进环境变量 → 后续请求自动带 Authorization。\n\n演示账号（密码都是 123456）：leader1=团长、user1=居民、admin1=管理员",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "① 登录（团长 leader1）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('code = 0 登录成功', () => pm.expect(res.code).to.eql(0));",
                  "pm.test('返回了 token', () => pm.expect(res.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.test('角色含 ROLE_LEADER', () => pm.expect(JSON.stringify(res.data.roles)).to.include('LEADER'));",
                  "if (res.code === 0 && res.data) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('userId', String(res.data.userId));",
                  "  console.log('✅ token 已写入环境变量，userId=' + res.data.userId);",
                  "  console.log('   ' + String(res.data.token).slice(0, 40) + '...');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"leader1\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "免登录。密码用 BCrypt 比对（库里存 $2a$10$...，无法反解）。\n\n**这一条必须先跑**，否则后面所有需要登录的请求都会返回 401。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "② 登录（居民 user1）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('code = 0', () => pm.expect(res.code).to.eql(0));",
                  "pm.test('角色含 ROLE_RESIDENT', () => pm.expect(JSON.stringify(res.data.roles)).to.include('RESIDENT'));",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_user', res.data.token);",
                  "console.log('居民 token 已存为 token_user（与团长的 token 分开）');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"user1\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "注意：这一条**不会**覆盖团长的 token，它存到 token_user。\n跑完记得再点一次「① 登录（团长）」，把默认 token 换回团长，否则开团会因权限不足失败。"
          }
        },
